     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">Hi,</font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">I am trying to run NewHybrids on a PC and I am having some\r\nissues getting it to work. I have tried a couple of things, so I’ll outline them\r\nhere using <a href=\"http://testset.gl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://testset.gl&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459406846000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ZSps8hrkRu3dPd7o2QY8V\">testset.gl</a> as the example dataset.</font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"> </font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">First, I ran the code below which is meant to create the\r\nNewHybrids input file, pass it over to the directory with the NewHybsPC.exe\r\nfile in it, then run the analysis. However, it doesn’t work and I get the warnings\r\nhighlighted in red below. No “nhyb.txt” outfile is created which I guess is the source of the problem in this case.</font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"> </font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"color:blue;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\">m\r\n&lt;- gl.nhybrids(<a href=\"http://testset.gl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://testset.gl&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459406846000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ZSps8hrkRu3dPd7o2QY8V\">testset.gl</a>, outfile=&quot;nhyb.txt&quot;,\r\noutpath=&quot;J:/Freshwater/JamesS/FWRP1805/RawData/BullySNPs/NewHybsPC&quot;, nhyb.directory=\r\n&quot;J:/Freshwater/JamesS/FWRP1805/RawData/BullySNPs/NewHybsPC&quot;,</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"color:blue;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span> </span><span>                 </span>p0=NULL, p1=NULL,</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"color:blue;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span> </span><span>                 </span>method=&quot;random&quot;,</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"color:blue;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span> </span><span>                 </span>BurnIn=50,</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"color:blue;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span> </span><span>                 </span>sweeps=90,</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"color:blue;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span> </span><span>                 </span>v=3)</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"color:blue;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"> </span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\">Starting\r\ngl.nhybrids: Assigning individual to hybrid categories</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span>  </span>No parental population specified </span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span>    </span>Selecting ca 200 random loci</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\">Subsampling\r\nat random, approximately 200 loci from genlight object </span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span>   </span>No. of loci retained = 128 </span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span>   </span>Note: SNP metadata discarded</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\">Converting\r\ndata to NewHybrids format</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span>  </span>Adding sequential number</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\">Writing\r\nthe NewHybrids input file J:/Freshwater/JamesS/FWRP1805/RawData/BullySNPs/NewHybsPC/nhyb.txt\r\n</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span>  </span>NumIndivs<span> \r\n</span>250 </span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span>  </span>NumLoci<span> \r\n</span>128<span>  </span></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span>  </span>Digits 1</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span>  </span>Format Lumped </span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:red;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\">The\r\nsystem cannot find the file specified.</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:red;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\">J:/Freshwater/JamesS/FWRP1805/RawData/BullySNPs/NewHybsPC</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:red;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\">J:\\Freshwater\\JamesS\\FWRP1805\\RawData\\BullySNPs\\NewHybsPC&gt;(</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\">echo\r\nnhyb.txt<span>  </span></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span> </span>echo 0<span>  \r\n</span></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span> </span>echo 0<span>  \r\n</span></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span> </span>echo 6 11<span>  \r\n</span></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span> </span>echo 0<span>  \r\n</span></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span> </span>echo 0<span>  \r\n</span></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span> </span>echo 50<span>  \r\n</span></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span> </span>echo 90<span> \r\n</span></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\">)<span>  </span>| NewHybrids_PC_1_1_WOG.exe</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\">Welcome\r\nto the program currently named &quot;NewHybrids&quot; Version 1.1 beta</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\">Pre-Released\r\n2 OCTOBER 2002.</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\">written\r\nby Eric C. Anderson (<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">er...@u.washington.edu</a>)</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\">Copyright\r\n(c) by The Regents of the University of California</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\">Please\r\nsee user documentation for full software agreement.</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\">-----------------------</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\">Enter\r\na </span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span>        </span>0 to load &quot;TestDat.txt&quot;</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span>        </span>1 to load &quot;TestDatWithOptions.dat&quot;</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span>        </span>2 to load &quot;TestAFLP.dat&quot;</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span>        </span>3 to load\r\n&quot;TestAFLPWithOptions.dat&quot;</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\">as\r\nthe Data File</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"> </span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\">Or\r\nenter the name of the file you wish to use.</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"> </span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\">Remember\r\nthat file must be in the directory in which</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\">the\r\nprogram resides.</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"> </span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:11.25pt\"><span style=\"padding:0cm;border:1pt windowtext;color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\">-&gt;</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=